Copyright 2026 The Flint authors

This package implements parts of the Java SE 21 java.time API. Its original
conformance fixtures use reference results produced by executing the public
Java SE 21 API.

Period's checked decimal reader is adapted from OpenJDK 21.0.13
(java/lang/Integer.java), copyright Oracle and/or its affiliates.

ZoneOffsetTransition is adapted from OpenJDK 21.0.13. Its source header
retains the Oracle and JSR-310 notices.

